WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:01.350
- All right, we're gonna end things

00:00:01.350 --> 00:00:03.360
with one last story to
brighten your day, hopefully.

00:00:03.360 --> 00:00:04.623
This is what I'm liking.

00:00:05.561 --> 00:00:06.868
(instrumental music)

00:00:06.868 --> 00:00:07.701
(audience applause)

00:00:07.701 --> 00:00:09.177
A Phoenix man is living proof

00:00:09.177 --> 00:00:11.595
of the ultimate love
between mother and son,

00:00:11.595 --> 00:00:14.070
you're gonna love this
story, and he certainly

00:00:14.070 --> 00:00:16.522
deserves the spotlight on
this national Son's day.

00:00:16.522 --> 00:00:18.000
His mom has been dealing

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.100
with a benign brain tumor for years.

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:22.260
She's okay, but with radiation

00:00:22.260 --> 00:00:25.770
she's lost all her hair and
doctors say it won't grow back.

00:00:25.770 --> 00:00:27.630
So, he's incredible

00:00:27.630 --> 00:00:30.000
and he decided to grow out his own hair

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.689
for two years and use it
to make a wig for his mama.

00:00:33.689 --> 00:00:34.522
(audience cooing)

00:00:34.522 --> 00:00:35.355
It's super sweet.

00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:37.740
We have Matt and Melanie

00:00:37.740 --> 00:00:41.010
on the line right now watching
on CBS five and three TV.

00:00:41.010 --> 00:00:41.843
Hello.

00:00:43.950 --> 00:00:44.783
- [Melanie] Hey Kelly.

00:00:44.783 --> 00:00:45.630
- [Matt] Hey.

00:00:45.630 --> 00:00:47.790
- Oh my gosh, Matt, I wish you were here,

00:00:47.790 --> 00:00:49.380
I wanna hug you so hard.

00:00:49.380 --> 00:00:50.910
And I mean, just, Well done Melanie.

00:00:50.910 --> 00:00:52.410
What a great son you have raised.

00:00:52.410 --> 00:00:53.370
What a great young man.

00:00:53.370 --> 00:00:56.160
Matt, you say this kind of
started as a joke though, right?

00:00:56.160 --> 00:00:57.810
- It kind of did.

00:00:57.810 --> 00:00:58.886
I was home between semesters from school

00:00:58.886 --> 00:01:03.886
and I go to a school with with
a pretty strict dress code.

00:01:04.230 --> 00:01:06.210
And then my parents jokingly said,

00:01:06.210 --> 00:01:08.010
Hey your hair's getting a little long.

00:01:08.010 --> 00:01:09.150
Maybe it's time for a haircut.

00:01:09.150 --> 00:01:10.500
To which I jokingly responded

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:14.018
Maybe I'll just keep growing
it and make a wig for you, mom.

00:01:14.018 --> 00:01:15.060
And then it just kind of clicked.

00:01:15.060 --> 00:01:18.570
And so, you know, a few
months down the road,

00:01:18.570 --> 00:01:19.860
I'm using different products.

00:01:19.860 --> 00:01:21.090
My sisters took me to the store

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:22.410
taught me all this stuff about my hair.

00:01:22.410 --> 00:01:23.280
(Kelly laughs)

00:01:23.280 --> 00:01:25.200
My mom would always
compliment me on my hair

00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:27.711
and I would say something along the lines

00:01:27.711 --> 00:01:29.574
of coming soon to a head near you.

00:01:29.574 --> 00:01:32.562
(Kelly and audience laughing)

00:01:32.562 --> 00:01:35.700
So I've learned a lot, but you know, it's,

00:01:35.700 --> 00:01:37.260
it was such a small gift to give

00:01:37.260 --> 00:01:39.861
to a mother who's given me everything.

00:01:39.861 --> 00:01:41.100
So it was a no brainer.

00:01:41.100 --> 00:01:44.760
- Melanie, that has to be the
coolest thing, like, you know

00:01:44.760 --> 00:01:46.170
to have to go through that in general,

00:01:46.170 --> 00:01:47.970
I've had friends that have had cancer and

00:01:47.970 --> 00:01:50.708
and that can be a hard
thing to go through.

00:01:50.708 --> 00:01:51.893
You know, the loss of hair

00:01:51.893 --> 00:01:54.084
the loss of sometimes
femininity like that happens

00:01:54.084 --> 00:01:55.893
and that's a beautiful thing that not just

00:01:55.893 --> 00:01:58.230
you have that wig to use,
but it, where it came from

00:01:58.230 --> 00:02:00.480
the roots of the whole
thing is so incredible.

00:02:00.480 --> 00:02:02.640
That's gotta feel pretty special, right?

00:02:02.640 --> 00:02:05.430
- Oh, it's absolutely amazing.

00:02:05.430 --> 00:02:08.560
When we went to get his
haircut, it was 12 inches long

00:02:09.638 --> 00:02:12.540
and as the last of it got snipped off

00:02:12.540 --> 00:02:14.340
all of us in the room started crying

00:02:15.720 --> 00:02:18.570
that it was just such a momentous gift.

00:02:18.570 --> 00:02:20.520
We mailed the hair away

00:02:20.520 --> 00:02:23.610
to a company that will create a custom wig

00:02:23.610 --> 00:02:25.830
out of the hair that you've donated.

00:02:25.830 --> 00:02:26.670
- [Kelly] Wow.

00:02:26.670 --> 00:02:30.370
- So it's so great that I have a wig that

00:02:31.260 --> 00:02:33.930
fits right and the color's right

00:02:33.930 --> 00:02:37.590
because it's our, you know,
my color, my son's color

00:02:37.590 --> 00:02:42.590
and that it came out of
compassion and sacrifice and love.

00:02:42.690 --> 00:02:43.800
- Oh my gosh.

00:02:43.800 --> 00:02:47.010
Wait, you need to write a,
a book on how to raise kids.

00:02:47.010 --> 00:02:48.870
Cause Matt, you are outstanding.

00:02:48.870 --> 00:02:50.730
That is a cool thing to do.

00:02:50.730 --> 00:02:53.010
Thank y'all so much, Matt,
Melanie, for sharing this story.

00:02:53.010 --> 00:02:55.200
I'm liking your post right now, alright?

00:02:55.200 --> 00:02:57.597
(bell dings)

00:02:57.597 --> 00:02:58.430
- [Melanie] Aww.

00:02:58.430 --> 00:03:00.090
- And that's not all,
our season long partner,

00:03:00.090 --> 00:03:02.370
Pilot Pen, makers of
Frixion, the go to erasable

00:03:02.370 --> 00:03:04.020
pen of the Kelly Clarkson Show,

00:03:04.020 --> 00:03:07.230
want to celebrate those creating
fearlessly just like y'all.

00:03:07.230 --> 00:03:08.700
So they're gonna give
you a thousand dollars.

00:03:08.700 --> 00:03:09.550
How's that sound?

00:03:11.312 --> 00:03:12.690
- You're kidding.

00:03:12.690 --> 00:03:14.320
- Thank you guys so much.

00:03:14.320 --> 00:03:16.080
Y'all have such a blessed evening.

00:03:16.080 --> 00:03:18.512
Thank you to all our guests
today, Rosie O'Donnell,

00:03:18.512 --> 00:03:21.810
Tyler James Williams,
Pearl, Karen, Kiante,

